exclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>Therefore, the sum of the series is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"84\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>   </p>\n</div></div>",
