><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>   </p>\n</div></div>",
